<title>USA: NYSE, AMEX to halt trading to remember vets.</title>
<headline>NYSE, AMEX to halt trading to remember vets.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York and American stock exchanges said they will stop trading and observe two minutes of silence at 1100 EST/1600 GMT in commemoration of U.S. Veterans Day.</p>
<p>Nasdaq said it would observe a voluntary moment of silence at 1200 EST /1700 GMT.</p>
